  "question": {
    "text": "If the sum of the coefficients of all the positive powers of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>, in the binomial expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>939</mn></math>, then the sum of all the possible integral values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
