  "correctValue": "57",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Plotting the table for coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup></math> and there cumulative sum :</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Coefficient</td>\t\t\t<td>Commulative sum</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>7</mn></mmultiscripts></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>7</mn></mmultiscripts></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>7</mn></mmultiscripts></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>84</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>7</mn></mmultiscripts></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>280</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>7</mn></mmultiscripts></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>280</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>560</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>939</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>5</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>7</mn></mmultiscripts></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8745;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8745;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>Sum&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>57</mn></math></p>",
